# Example

# A small API

<a id="entry-626f78"></a>

## box

```nash
type box 'a
    = Box 'a
```

Kind: `Type -> Type`

A little container.

<a id="entry-6964656e74697479"></a>

## identity

```nash
identity : 'a -> 'a
```

Preserve a value.

```nash
identity 42
```

<a id="entry-28252529"></a>

## (%%)

```nash
(%%) : 'a -> 'b -> 'a
infix left 5 (%%) = combine
```

Infix form of `Example.combine`.


